Setup COMPILER_PATH, SRC_PATH and OUTPUT_PATH in env_setup.sh

- Build command:

$ ./launch_build

- Clean command:

$ ./clean.sh

ANNOTATIONS:

- Run launch_build and follow the guidance to start compilation

- Build processes of PC_LINUX, EMBEDDED_LINUX and EMBEDDED_BAREMENTAL are all integrated in launch_build

- Default compilation options can be adjust in the first part of launch_build

- Running clean.sh before launch_build is recommended

- Compilation time-consumption statics is supported in launch_build